# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# HF_TOKEN — HuggingFace access token.
# Needed because the DINOv3 backbone (facebook/dinov3-vitb16-pretrain-lvd1689m) is
# access-gated: the weights require both a valid token AND manual approval on the model
# page. A valid token on an unapproved account still returns 403.
#
# Create at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens  (read scope is sufficient)
# Request model access at: https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov3-vitb16-pretrain-lvd1689m
#
# On the GPU box, prefer `huggingface-cli login` so the token never lands in a file.
HF_TOKEN=
